# Field generator (the Emitter): projects the friendly lantern field while powered by its grid. The
# Game layer overrides the live output every tick (0 when unpowered); authored Output/Reach are the
# powered values' defaults only. Spawned with its origin at half height (1.0) above the ground hit.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; Scale is uniform, so the pieces are the baseshapes variants): a tall stone pedestal
# (the root) with a bronze cap, and a DIAMOND that floats high over it (gems.obj), above the 2x2x2 m collider
# box, so a field generator shows from far. The child pieces are render-only.
Prefab gameEmitter
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar2
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.52 0.5 0.46
		Position 0 -0.2 0
		Scale 0.4
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
	Component Force
		Team 0
		Output 1.2
		Reach 12
		Centered true
		Direction 0 1 0
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
		AlwaysShowResources true
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Collar
			Position 0 0.72 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.6 0.42 0.18
				Scale 0.55
		Entity
			Name Crystal
			Position 0 1.85 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer gemsGlow
				Node Diamond
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 1 0.85 0.45
				Emissive 2.5
				Scale 0.6
